site('Sarutaru','Assam','Neolithic assemblage','Ground celts and pottery in excavated contexts.','No measured occupation age adopted here.','ARCH-08','pp.194–198','checked passage','Reconcile field-season ranges and later relocation.','01, 06, 07')
